  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFIT - Global Strategic Partnership for Peace and Reconciliation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership aims to help fragile and conflict-affected states achieve more successful negotiations and transitions out of war, crisis or authoritarianism. Through its operating model, IFIT seeks to move current practice away from fragmented interventions and toward more integrated solutions that are more likely to strengthen peace and reconciliation. IFIT operates along the following work strains: country brain trusts, thematic practice groups, global initiatives, and research and pulibcations.</narrative>
  </description>
